{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1563,
  "batch_count": 1701,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "624b11ee6bac4894f9e1bac15c5037fc7d787286",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0f4ffd0b63b8c1242ff470b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我不能赞同。继续这种\n鲁莽的做法，迟早会撑不住的。\n我不愿那样。――绝对，不愿意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69b0529482ce15a3a1401b9e2f26c65fb793ed1b2ee27769ad02e4971d63c38b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f98f39e87354210a4055fde5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态已经好到极点，\n完全无可挑剔！\n就这样一路直冲――向着胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bf99f3814117c0d1fb50df20842c63437681feb4ae6aa3fad99fe373377a108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c8290a895fe5b5c14650fe1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要始终强烈渴望，\n无论哪里都能抵达。\n就像飞越大海的蝴蝶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "846cd7f223c1d3b20b9bafe612d779d029ad21ba0f86e35c0590b87ae70c1065",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75580c712e75ac2e6aae0bf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有什么是无法超越的。\n只要心中，\n怀着坚定的信念！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c934ab247a80b67423cfd9e6e76ca86bd9ef6040b786ba08e2f30c7ce784a87b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5374afed39f70bf52924c8b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有那么多人――有那么多声音，\n都在呼唤我的名字……\n呵呵，真的让我充满力量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "305df616b4e97a1da6099747a5238b53809aca58daa1fa89695699b8f0b19b10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd5696573e4c255aa984a0d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要的东西，\n我会一直伸手去争取。\n直到亲手将它――牢牢握住！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb255ddd527b41818ee1c8a8da82a526b699ce2c699686f8e071f520809a2843",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eb49932ced2b38196126dd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备都已经做好了。\n无论面对怎样的局面\n我都能灵活应对！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bccf08e448f92eb3d784aaa0944510d2ab9eb358b5fc337b7bf06f355efc0fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b29ee7d6083fccfdd01e6f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是怎样的诅咒还是常识，\n都与我无关。\n用这双腿，我只为取胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "293a29d6360ca77dd97a4ce4ab4283acdc591b7c0e16f54d91bc0d6856bd22d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cbf4eddbeb77d77ae5ea115",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论从什么位置我都会追上并反超。\n我就是为此而奔跑的。\n每天的努力都是为了这一刻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "400e503498d2731af4ebbb99db0d7494ba791e6274f5b0a6f7b614eb45c0a2ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:207e590b23d3bc496245f9ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奔跑的理由只有一个。\n——因为我就是想赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebf88e41aa963bb2c382830f111888bbc69ccc791054175894f1db8ac1b8f1d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7205da6ab2c1888b03109f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这点波动完全在预料之中……\n没问题，我能调整过来……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e09040a7dc3db1b6217cc8e471a486a6978c6f72f4ad83efab55fc736bb98f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4847fe277ae6c66daff74fae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道只要坚持做自己，\n就没有什么跨越不了的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bef9b13bad8497f0849da18c911063fc7898b9a6f93e3065b686cc32b3cf534f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8445c0a0b9bfae8377c04073",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不想输。\n无论是对谁…包括对我自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35d1d865f6312a2ef0f18ef51015e8cadc0520498f24cb420006561feac11349",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffcd93eb11bb7e13e299b98d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能行的，我…！\n因为，我从未认为\n自己做不到…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d1030b031e549642fae9e80be4f3fe774a677a8b8594878f1cac764c165551b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb523c0da0ebd2060611fd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝不怀疑自己的\n实力……！无论何时！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bdab167090da06a6d38fefa16f20ae2ba968292df277dfce208003b783a014a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6782ec8b7a24b8f9f714b4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题……\n我不会踉跄……\n绝对不会有事的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d83ff02390c92ba0ad06ff0e5abb0dbc4fe1a1fb193ac5cb9198a77bba4e0f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93de92d356e6e155595fddaa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc2b0db28278f979f108f6e626eeaf8ff4553286870fbc94ddfa52a96348396a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3129ae9d2753e3bd2557dbd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96bfa07bcbc2af5c82be8a3f8a660d82a8af34152ea8aa0b87d81c424d76c637",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:757e211c7583c8bf31cab66d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0fb22d63cfcb2e2e78399b13eaa4eff734162d1507e6bfb93a1a695cb8e40a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d8a1d45ed97d922f04da49d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c1bb480ed0811432e377c03a073021704dea1af4170f367125bc0d9553854df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db48f4b973442cfd347beba1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶诶！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d56bc1436af70c5ee5f61b07ea7fbe279895fb581c60b13476b29d6f4e350e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fea58e3f189d7fafa46419e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "55d62764ccc18450bc29a87356c49484cd31be597f6410d65689ef109e2fc74d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c2615149489af718b9726b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f0665e0a69c08888c3252e4588492414e62eb2a101e0b2a5a81f3189d824bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae98fa695157e94361da8779",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好期待呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "684bfed99b8b8f954dca2f5169c4763a964877f3b4647f311b33387865e35a80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf3ddd61bd30cbb34df1e742",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会把这次经历化作力量，继续向前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88fc809a52f69f919856e88f329a1b741349c2c20ae0db96f43e3b9d7bd318ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ff76445214d78b88987b2ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你陪我一路走来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa3afcd5cd8a0d4cd6503d25ad305710c3e588bc72a7d7a2605fb2e66633dbc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab3b369f03a4a92ce6ccbae5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可不会手下留情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8c6faa27e0713740a69c04d2581d36eed0726d8dfe74f0707615c8ccaa1206b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73f5f7600c633c3bef72f39f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，要出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "849c0c3b42eb2774cbe0975112a27fbd3b244514467ef4ff9ae527ddc51556b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e5b53aea64c5f8304f0b41e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都准备好了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bd62305465b83e9e8f57e9731002c19939ec50ac4ee6b53b035815eaa94a9ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca95ecce571fc5a8631322d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你陪我一路走来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa3afcd5cd8a0d4cd6503d25ad305710c3e588bc72a7d7a2605fb2e66633dbc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ab3870dfe6ec696f7ecebfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备万全哦。\n无论什么情况\n都能灵活应对！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3900985fac1b6133652b90e6f8016332d7060ba8a33b32ea8617e64d4f3bd84a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1d60f62640c948f92abc640",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有什么是无法超越的。\n只要心中，\n怀着坚定的信念！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c934ab247a80b67423cfd9e6e76ca86bd9ef6040b786ba08e2f30c7ce784a87b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ed8aff55ae037d11399260d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你陪我一路走来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa3afcd5cd8a0d4cd6503d25ad305710c3e588bc72a7d7a2605fb2e66633dbc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50cfa031dda380f60d55295f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc2b0db28278f979f108f6e626eeaf8ff4553286870fbc94ddfa52a96348396a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f80374745873cb6e5a888a7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定要赢给所有人看！绝对！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d38a85d4cc915173bb3b20e3a4d6e33ee239d7b3405ca96c49062a05355d24f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f45da9144019553f836bb86d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次我会变得更强更强，绽放出耀眼光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e27cb35fdab34e317b0dab5f918bcda7eddfdbacdf63726feaa1861910b6466",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0df2b4347d7ae205d452b72e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这不是终点…因为我还没有放弃！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f1d8791cb58f3cb5a8ecf115d12843c9daac3d961c7ec549704e4723942895b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e121d01fb2e907d1fdd386cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论多少次我都会重新站起来…不管多少次…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6de809865cf25f27109dd8fb86162032bebc6f66b98fd0e8107645248d77f425",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8af7b46a161e3c6f074351d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "杏目，绝不会输！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2a1c592bdcc035331497013820317955718eadfc645a69000a53acdcd8c9c26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01976cbf12981538b7bf89bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有什么是我这双手抓不住的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f679e2d7680fa986b33d4999693a7fcec310bea1cccdd930950053dffc947dcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b69c1287151ca900fe9c4c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "决胜的时刻！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61abca981c523b9c5cf0cba11ab77d05cecc5f37ba5ebe56c1bd23c831c6e46a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88b829139f4075e4529ef425",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不会输的，我可是杏目！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2cf477ccdd95316a8e17f4cf9f8f2790c65af8cf960dd8ded80bc32399101f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad020b4043a1c189dc277364",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，好刺眼……不过，我可不打算\r\n输给夏日的阳光。\r\n防晒霜已经准备万全了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4144d90b65458b5fcc625f5faeac94e7697114b761b84ab4163c3d5058994301",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd777ead3c1f378980555134",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈～～～！我居然什么都没做！！\r\n这么懒散的夏天，有生以来第一次\r\n――好，从明天开始努力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "445cc2d99a93c097e1afe9a9aefb6b5139a4b6a50ac541879ab2576bfd5f8ed8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4ccb4058dd40c9769199183",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要一次次地赢下去……\n将无人见过的光辉\n握在这双手中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60597d02fe679e49776ff2c0d60544a5672131c0ec5de1169cfad260182b24bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f642102bcdbbf3b6baf941a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……天空同学，还在向我\r\n炫耀钓鱼大赛获胜的事……！\r\n明年，我一定会赢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5384903185e6cd88a5588e3553e7c361fc93d6160cc50c8cf38e276332dbc448",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a67be37220f1087eceeefa1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表现方面我也有自己的讲究。好好看着吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dc63a3e24f87363d3902f905621ee2312c63ebafb7250a0f2b4aafd45471c7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3452a49de9eb86707f5dc2eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摄像机在这里，在那里，接着还有……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb3993258f8ab46ec3dcdd79469a9908430f9749988ed4f89f305aed6daee1bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:954af63bd1ea6948697038af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为想赢所以要赢。仅此而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e18eec1d92174ac2c35d9193785077b923a5e57ed3a58fba30f80b744439de4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c41a646a71e12de2d7e30ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要再并肩跑一次？我用\n这双腿，你骑那时候的摩托。\n无论到哪里都一路破风而行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e61df5677311168d11d5733c1a04bbbd3cfe06e547ba47770de093ab53e5358f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:944c13e7b9bee30bca1f0d9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学习方面我很有信心。每门课都不例外。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67efe1c8be89bd36e4b1e480c19752ce4278402dc82d06e82cc55c4d5ef79e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96a2e1eb04ed68fd6e2ac9a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然要穿，我就想穿得比任何人都好看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15b2c811c4cf0379e01468a2cd947ae16f76fb7b0d0cd3e49ea805d53e2569d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6e2603e604c9f736184ccdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论在世界哪个角落，这条蝴蝶结就是标志哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cbfd97752cfe3c21749f8a4aa71b6fcef2ae2a1d0dfeb5793be3bbd006e2208",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53189b0d212de1e7a29d2bbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢这款蹄铁的设计。",
      "source_fingerprint": "779710c2963d3e28acaf71909771979b5ec66bb798864831b292580a633e6236",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74ddf4fa25ef131584993f39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得自己的身体相当柔韧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f63ebb462a75334d48e47a9cb588cd942d7f3278f755249f69feba00a61075a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06d47ea00f509dbba3dc4f3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黑色是点睛之笔。有了它整体显得更利落对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "010e2bc8fe2e5c5dca12fca4203a86150477f4d7bb8067aae8b216145ebc91ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8941a70c583e07e20b82cac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尺码和穿着感都挺好的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0fc2dbede25bd7f20e9e027fd245fdb0702723f762738d4d9df8bc5b1fa2e5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16637b3c1d9d2d8830f1efab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，这件我也喜欢上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e9d3dab64a91180c039e624206d873a76813ccec8573715b68d09bc18dc1a89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f4d57323fee96ecd61d3beb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "防爆装束经常约我一起去购物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d06688c48b230dd7eaf911a1f8ff8f46f2e86a6d213ae8cff677f140b36a588",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19557058186afe564905bb5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我稍微做了美甲哦。注意到了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2a00c4f4fe6aebeda914f6c9e49af2c27f635be14f8cb68f081120884d61b43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e60fd4de62a3612d0545746f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学习方面我很有信心。每门课都不例外。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67efe1c8be89bd36e4b1e480c19752ce4278402dc82d06e82cc55c4d5ef79e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5c1d4863f71eb64e2c059f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然要穿，我就想穿得比任何人都好看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15b2c811c4cf0379e01468a2cd947ae16f76fb7b0d0cd3e49ea805d53e2569d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bda4800a8c5fee0baca32cb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论在世界哪个角落，这条蝴蝶结就是标志哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cbfd97752cfe3c21749f8a4aa71b6fcef2ae2a1d0dfeb5793be3bbd006e2208",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c227bd60d816fc100b748480",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢这款蹄铁的设计。",
      "source_fingerprint": "779710c2963d3e28acaf71909771979b5ec66bb798864831b292580a633e6236",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
