      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82f227ad1fb04934f7fce73e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得自己的身体相当柔韧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f63ebb462a75334d48e47a9cb588cd942d7f3278f755249f69feba00a61075a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b98db3e0dcbb0c47cacfe797",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黑色是点睛之笔。有了它整体显得更利落对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "010e2bc8fe2e5c5dca12fca4203a86150477f4d7bb8067aae8b216145ebc91ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec65946c6bf323ad4f98a6f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尺码和穿着感都挺好的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0fc2dbede25bd7f20e9e027fd245fdb0702723f762738d4d9df8bc5b1fa2e5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c43d7c657fc3313923a46cc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，这件我也喜欢上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e9d3dab64a91180c039e624206d873a76813ccec8573715b68d09bc18dc1a89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d5f08cdeedf44308ec84099",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d63a5ff1ef283e54835ff20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早起一分，强一分。\n既然如此，选项只有一个。\n你也是这样想的对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1f80b7134f48ffe0b8f0d4cac2506594c98913d587fe7a08bbf0d7ade0520a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd4672a3c6d9e1651605797e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一天从整理床铺\n开始。把床单铺得平整无皱以后\n我的早晨才算开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47bebd90a2d8b6d4e228fee44a57c581cf14ab9ee3f56e9bfbd6c10e93f7af32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:613d1653fb07263aa63d94f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐由我自己做并控制好\n热量与PFC平衡。比赛当然要\n以最佳体型迎战嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fd85e6b3aa883c1f3e7dd8b1cb11d07b10b0274a3aa46d9f3dea6715b1abb9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d35d7211b2aef4474ad2c00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白天的拉伸非常重要哦。\n来，你也摆好拉伸姿势！\n背部拉伸，要我帮你压一压吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "338e2e423b99d7e8c890d72f1f10f6c722d32e132148f94d53ca1ff6709d9ca5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aace259ed5a054e35d1f096",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然想泡久一点但泡得太久\n对健康不好。正因如此，\n每天泡澡时更要好好享受。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0652363edd01f1944e51be72d383d437ba986d59f4caa3e4427fad229a16b49d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a538385240d09ef31507f64c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天需要反省的地方已经全写好了。\n接下来只要逐一克服它们！\n我现在就已经开始期待明天了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d1d2aeedeb51a67ef5187f0801b4570ee0c8e7147fa8c1925c2dc88f902c70d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7b0c322988b918e8075f74e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢在樱花下比赛。\n获胜之后再看樱花，\n会觉得它更美对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a65d829352a279314303fa160e1ce594061f01bd87fd21974b0b0cdc56936d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0de13d746997e585494a73d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "炎炎夏日里的冷水澡，绝了…！\n还有黄瓜。就靠这两样，\n夏天也能轻松度过！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93383a4c3e321517b4540c47f067ed63d947be14ee32786616a07020eeb62f03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b72db8fbc92c132870c0de0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "读书也好运动也好艺术也好…\n什么都要不留遗憾地享受！\n一点时间都不能浪费！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9a18126e0e792d3a6ddd8760f468bee743c496de8bb279a9e958c5d962b7e19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b515a2874c80ab5e3c78456",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被子盖得太多，防爆装束说\n我简直像块千层酥！\n……不过不着凉才最重要对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebc6ca18eecb92265381f37e35ef63b4b818f4df12bdb84700f850a0f35986cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ab510a22c1001ce62999507",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b864b7841af89022e20379f78c16aa3ac36fd63bcfd3cb24ab6d04b749dcdc58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90020"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
